<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> a skos:ConceptScheme;
    skos:definition "The GROUPs and HEADINGs of the AGS 4.2.0 data dictionary (Electronic Transfer of Geotechnical and Geoenvironmental Data). Groups are top concepts and each heading is a narrower concept of every group it appears in. Group categories are collections."@en;
    skos:prefLabel "AGS 4.2.0 Groups and Headings"@en;
